      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this prime mixed-use investment property comprising an entire self-contained building with a ground floor commercial unit and three self-contained one-bedroom residential units, ideally positioned at 10 North King Street in Dublin 7.\r\n10 North King Street is a prime mixed-use investment opportunity extending to four self-contained units in a highly accessible city centre location. The property comprises a ground floor commercial unit and three self-contained residential units. The commercial unit has excellent visibility and footfall and the residential accommodations benefit from separate access.  Situated in Dublin 7, the property is within walking distance of the city centre, Smithfield, Stoneybatter, TU Dublin Grangegorman, the Four Courts, the Docklands and the Mater Hospital. The area is supported by excellent public transport links including Dublin Bus services and nearby LUAS access along with a wide range of cafes, restaurants, retail outlets, and local amenities. This is an ideal opportunity for investors seeking a well-located mixed-use investment in one of Dublin’s most established rental markets. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a residential investment in a prime Dublin city centre location. Viewings are strictly by appointment call RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n\r\n- c. 200 Sqm\r\n-Mixed-use Investment opportunity\r\n-3 Self-contained 1 bedroom units\r\n-Excellent Transport Routes closeby\r\n-Walking distance to O’Connell Street\r\n-Within walking distance of TU Dublin Grangegorman\r\n-Within Walking distance of The Mater Hospital\r\n-Prime City Centre Location\r\n-Strong and consistent rental demand"
      }
